stance, angular momentum, \nand bounce simulation. Every flip feels different. Every landing is earned.\n\n- COLLECT & CUSTOMIZE\nUnlock 3 bottle types (Plastic, Glass, Metal) — each with unique physics \nbehaviour. Choose from 8 bottle skins, use power-ups like Slow Motion, \nDouble Jump and Stabilizer to gain the edge.\n\n- DAILY CHALLENGES & REWARDS\nComplete 4 gameplay challenges every day to earn coins and bonuses. Log in \ndaily to grow your streak and multiply your rewards.\n\n- SPEND YOUR COINS\nBuy coin packs, unlock premium bottles, rare skins, and power-ups in the \nfully-featured in-game store.\n\n- COMPETE & CLIMB\nLocal leaderboards track your best scores across all modes. Can you reach \nthe top of the podium?\n\n- Why Choose FlipGamer?\n\n• Privacy-Focused Design\n• Smooth UI experience\n• Battery-efficient performance\n• Download now and experience a smarter way to use.\n\nFREE TO PLAY — FAIR & FUN\nDOWNLOAD FREE — start flipping today!\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/  \nPrivacy Policy: https://theflipgamer.blogspot.com/2026/07/privacy-policy-for-flipgamer.html", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "3524608", "formattedPrice": "무료", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "averageUserRating": 0, "trackCensoredName": "FlipGamer - Tap to Jump!", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/flipgamer-tap-to-jump/id6787615235?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "minimumOsVersion": "17.0", "userRatingCount": 0}]}